   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 5.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A few quick rules, for checking your answers and for the days you don’t have time to draw."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 5.825,
   "speechStart": 5.825,
   "end": 9.55,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "A current directly with you: add its drift to your speed."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 9.8,
   "speechStart": 9.8,
   "end": 12.525,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Directly against you: subtract it."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 12.775,
   "speechStart": 12.775,
   "end": 16.5,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Ten knots into a two-knot current is eight over the ground."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 16.75,
   "speechStart": 16.75,
   "end": 22.025,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "A current across your track: steer up-current, by the amount the diagram gives you."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 22.275,
   "speechStart": 22.275,
   "end": 24.35,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Wind does the same thing."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 24.6,
   "speechStart": 24.6,
   "end": 30.2,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "When it pushes the boat sideways, that’s called leeway, and you treat it just like a current."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 30.45,
   "speechStart": 30.45,
   "end": 33.425,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "And how much should you trust a predicted current?"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 33.675,
   "speechStart": 34.425,
   "end": 36.525,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Only until your next fix."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 36.775,
   "speechStart": 36.775,
   "end": 39.0,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Predictions are estimates."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 39.25,
   "speechStart": 39.25,
   "end": 42.4,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So keep taking fixes, and keep adjusting."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 42.65,
   "speechStart": 42.65,
   "end": 44.525,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That’s lesson nine."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 44.775,
   "speechStart": 44.775,
   "end": 47.2,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Set runs from DR to fix."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 47.45,
   "speechStart": 47.45,
   "end": 49.7,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Current first, then your speed."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 49.95,
   "speechStart": 49.95,
   "end": 51.65,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Steer up-current."
  },
  {
